{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus datasource holding etcd mixin metrics",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Reference etcd health dashboard from the etcd Prometheus mixin. Not deployed by nke-stack. $cluster is the Prometheus job label.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "etcd mixin",
      "tooltip": "",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/tree/main/contrib/mixin"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Requirements and scope",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Scope\nReference etcd health dashboard derived from the upstream Prometheus mixin. It is not deployed by nke-stack. Import this JSON and select a Prometheus datasource. Empty panels mean etcd is not scraped.\n\n### Source\nQueries and panel set come from the [etcd mixin](https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/tree/main/contrib/mixin) (`contrib/mixin/dashboards/targets.libsonnet` and `panels.libsonnet`). Default mixin config (`config.libsonnet`) uses `etcd_selector: job=~\".*etcd.*\"` and `clusterLabel: job`, so `$cluster` here is the Prometheus **job** label, not a Kubernetes cluster name.\n\n### Mixin panels included\n- Up \u2014 `sum(etcd_server_has_leader{...})` (members with a leader, not scrape `up{}`)\n- RPC rate \u2014 unary `grpc_server_started_total` vs failed unary `grpc_server_handled_total`\n- Active streams \u2014 Watch and Lease bidi (`started \u2212 handled`)\n- DB size \u2014 allocated vs in-use bytes (fragmentation / defrag)\n- Disk sync duration \u2014 p99 WAL fsync and p99 backend commit\n- Memory \u2014 `process_resident_memory_bytes`\n- Client/peer traffic in/out\n- Total leader elections per day \u2014 `changes(etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total[1d])`\n- Peer round trip time \u2014 p99\n\n### Metric dependencies\netcd must be scraped (kube-prometheus-stack can scrape kube-etcd when enabled; nke-stack does not enable that by default)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Up",
      "description": "Count of etcd members that currently have a leader (etcd_server_has_leader), not Prometheus scrape up{}.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(etcd_server_has_leader{job=~\".*etcd.*\",job=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{cluster}} - {{namespace}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "No scrape"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RPC rate",
      "description": "Unary gRPC RPC rate vs failed unary RPCs (Unknown, FailedPrecondition, ResourceExhausted, Internal, Unavailable, DataLoss, DeadlineExceeded).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(grpc_server_started_total{job=~\".*etcd.*\",job=\"$cluster\",grpc_type=\"unary\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "RPC rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "1m"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(grpc_server_handled_total{job=~\".*etcd.*\",job=\"$cluster\",grpc_type=\"unary\",grpc_code=~\"Unknown|FailedPrecondition|ResourceExhausted|Internal|Unavailable|DataLoss|DeadlineExceeded\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "RPC failed rate",
          "refId": "B",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active streams",
      "description": "Watch and Lease bidi streams currently open (started minus handled).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
